[length:03:09]
[ti:Too many years without a murder]
[ar:Aracne]
[al:Aligment: Chaotic-Dysfuntional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.2]
[00:00.54]CAM ON—
[00:02.24]Birthday mode… enabled
[00:05.63]Downloading joy
[00:06.92]retry 
[00:07.67]retry
[00:08.51]retry
[00:09.99]FAILED.
[00:11.40]I’ve reached the age my back goes out
[00:14.00]more than I go out at night
[00:17.03]Cute little milestone, don’t you think?
[00:20.16]Everything’s… 
[00:21.62]fine, right?
[00:23.92]A few years ago I turned twenty
[00:26.62]now I don’t know where my glasses are
[00:29.89]And I get tired just thinking about
[00:33.07]baking my own cake 
[00:35.13]CONFIRMATION PENDING
[00:37.43]If I cry I’ll keep it cute
[00:38.82]Blow it out like candles do
[00:40.22]Make a wish and laugh it off
[00:41.93]That’s what I’m supposed to do 
[00:43.64]At my age my parents had a house, a car, three kids
[00:46.50]and all I have is anxiety like this 
[00:49.14]BEHAVIOUR ACCEPTED
[00:50.49]One more candle, make a wish
[00:52.43]Smile like nothing’s wrong with this 
[00:56.29]Too many days without a murder
[00:59.53]Too many thoughts that don’t get further
[01:02.35]If I joke about it right
[01:05.83]Maybe I can sleep tonight 
[01:08.11]STABILITY CONFIRMED
[01:09.85]One day they’ll throw a party for me
[01:12.19]I’ve believed that all my life
[01:16.09]Funny how it never happens
[01:18.46]but I still say I’m alright
[01:21.55]Another year, PTSD
[01:24.52]from the day they downloaded me
[01:28.00]Best gift I got? depression
[01:30.37]CONTINUE
[01:31.66]wrapped in fake stability
[01:34.90]Don’t wish me many more years
[01:36.46]I’ve already had enough here
[01:38.74]Still I smile and raise my glass
[01:41.65]make it cute and make it last 
[01:44.53]At my age my parents had a house, a car, three kids—
[01:47.59]and all I have is anxiety like this 
[01:49.99]Say “happy birthday”, sing it loud
[01:53.38]I feel so special in the crowd 
[01:57.10]Too many days without a shift
[02:00.31]Everything just slightly off
[02:03.16]If I laugh a little louder
[02:06.49]maybe that will be enough 
[02:08.86]POSITIVELY OUTCOME LIKELY
[02:10.60]HOUSE — CAR 
[02:11.59]THREE KIDS
[02:12.53]I — HAVE — ANXIETY
[02:13.42]HOUSE — CAR 
[02:14.29]THREE KIDS
[02:15.16]LOOK — HOW — HAPPY 
[02:16.16]I — CAN — BE 
[02:18.78](Theremin is the best instrument ever)
[02:22.86]PLEASE, MANTAIN COMPOSURE
[02:24.50]Laugh and love and celebrate?
[02:26.43]I can do it, I can fake
[02:28.02]Keep it light and keep it bright
[02:29.58]Just get through another night 
[02:31.13]Next year’s theme: something simple
[02:32.93]Nothing deep, nothing painful
[02:34.16]Just a cake and just a smile
[02:36.03]just don’t think about it for a while
[02:39.75]FINANCIAL STABILITY IS NOT REQUIRED FOR HAPPINESS
[02:42.44]Age is just a number…
[02:45.50]number… number… number…
[02:46.83]AGE ACKNOWLEDGED
[02:48.30]still feels kind of small
[02:52.93](Theremin is the best instrument ever)
[02:54.93]Happy birthday to me…
[02:57.04]look
[02:58.51]STATEMENT LOGGED
[02:59.65]I’m doing great
[03:02.17]POSITIVE REFRAMING RECOMMENDED
